{"id":"654018762","kind":"article","title":"数学头脑","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Thinking_Mathematics"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2023-09-07","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":591,"keywords":["数学教育","问答式教学","概念先备知识","概率论","组合数学"],"summary":"作者设想能否像《物理头脑》那样用问答方式教数学，认为数学可能需要先引入更多术语和概念，因而较难让所有读者立即进入提问；概率论和组合数学或许更适合这种写法。更新中，他补充说，物理问题往往可直接向所有人提出，而数学问题常需先解释定义与证明。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/654018762","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"L5ZVgt4N\"><b>数学头脑</b>或者说<b>物理头脑的数学版本</b>，是一本用<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Thinking_Physics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《物理头脑》</a>的方式教授数学的假想数学书。</p><p data-pid=\"jBGm88wD\">有<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Thinking_Economics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《经济头脑》</a>吗？基本上是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Thinking_Physics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《物理头脑》</a>的经济学版本。</p><p data-pid=\"YliNgDPA\">实际上有《数学头脑》这样的书吗？（可能是 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AOPS</a> 的书？）这种方式似乎不太适合数学，但我不太能表述清楚。也许你需要<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Tinkering_in_math_requires_loading_the_situation_into_working_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">让读者掌握一大堆术语和概念甚至才能开始问问题</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。概率论/组合数学是少数不必引入太多术语也能讨论的数学分支（这可能就是 AoPS 的书读起来非常享受的原因）。</p><p data-pid=\"bH99wrxH\">更新：我觉得一问一答模式在《物理头脑》行得通的原因，是这些问题可以用来问所有人，他们都能理解，而不像数学一样，非得先讲一大堆概念，或者解释什么是什么证明才行。</p><p data-pid=\"3ucq8QHw\">有一些书试图采取问答形式，像 H.S. Wall 所著的《创意数学》，以及《窥自初等问题的数学精要》，但这两本书我都没有深入读过。</p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">参见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"5CCtY_JH\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Duolingo_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的多邻国</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"aWDaF4nq\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Braid_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的 Braid</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Braid+for+math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链入</a>)<br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"piBt4fSg\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Duolingo_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的多邻国</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Duolingo+for+math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"lheJ9cU-\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Braid_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的 Braid</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Braid+for+math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链入</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"SFhx_ohA\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Tinkering_in_math_requires_loading_the_situation_into_working_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">捣鼓数学需要将数学情景载入工作记忆</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Tinkering+in+math+requires+loading+the+situation+into+working+memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← links</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"VclA5MH6\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Thinking_Physics_for_math&amp;redirect=no\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《物理头脑》的数学版本</a> (redirect page) ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Thinking+Physics+for+math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← links</a>)</li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"vBVRZMYv\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">S</span>hom、校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Thinking_Mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thinking Mathematics</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 数学探索需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"713659217\" href=\"#/post/713659217\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"654018458","title":"数学概念有不同的心理表征，这对于制作数学探索媒介是个挑战","author":"Issa Rice","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"655682223","title":"直播数学视频","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"713659217","title":"数学探索需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆","author":"Issa Rice","votes":20,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"715765481","title":"面向数学的《时空幻境》","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}